# label | keys | help key | on or off

global
  quit | ctrl+c | ^c | on
  maximize | Z | Z | on
  help | ? | ? | on

Checks
  checks | esc | esc | on
  rerun failed | R | R | on
  refresh | r | r | on
  browser | o | o | on

Log
  annotations | A | A | on
  up | up k | ↑/k | off
  down | down j | ↓/j | off
  open file | enter | ↵ | off
